            standing_height: Some(65.8),
            composition: None,
            default_brain: "patrol_peaceful",
            // THE KIT (Jon, 2026-10-10, after he fought the guide): "They should have
            // the ability to be offensive." A guide that is provoked fights with its
            // slate. This replaces the ruling that closed D56 ("Do not invent a combat
            // kit or capabilities merely to fill the definition"): the kit is here
            // because Jon asked for it, and it is two attacks and no ability.
            default_action_set: "kernel_guide_slate",
