            tier: MainHall,
            body_kind: Standard,
            composition: None,
            //  NAMES NO PRESET (2026-08-12, D81). Its DEFINITION authors a
            // policy, and the preset it used to name carried `aggressiveness:
            // 1.0` — which is HOSTILITY, and hostility is what an `EnemySpawn`
            // placement already means.  the parrot's case was the opposite and
            // that is why this is safe: `0.0` SUPPRESSED hostility, so dropping
