            idle: ["Scribble.", "Hee.", "I was drawn in a meeting. Nobody was listening."],
            hall: ["Somebody drew me in a margin and forgot to rub me out. Their mistake.", "I am a first draft. There are three of us. We are all first drafts."],
        ),
        ),
