            idle: ["Derivative.", "*scribbles* 'Wooden.'", "One star. I am being generous."],
            hall: ["I do not make art. I make art nervous. It is a calling.", "Everyone is a critic. I am the only one who brought tomatoes."],
        ),
        ),
