        // The locust swarm: many locusts that fly as one body and make a face
        // (Drought and Famine). It floats and wheels; it pulls itself into a
        // ball (its windup row) and streams at you. It has no spit: a floater
        // that strikes in melee dives, so it is `Aerial`.
