            idle: ["*flutter flutter*", "*its antennae twitch*", "*it bumps into a lantern, on purpose*"],
            hall: ["*five thousand years of silk farming bred the flying out of its kind. It is trying anyway.*", "*a whole road is named after what its caterpillar spins. It is quietly proud.*"],
        ),
        ),

