            idle: ["*the horse snorts*", "Five spare horses, one bow, no hurry.", "We eat in the saddle. We sleep in the saddle. Ask me about the saddle."],
            hall: ["We ride away, you chase, and we turn round in the saddle and shoot. The Parthians did it first. We did it further.", "A messenger of the Yam crossed the empire in days: at each station he changed horses. Sometimes he changed riders. Never the bow."],
        ),
        ),
        // The golden eagle: a falconer's eagle with its hood pushed back. It
        // flies, and it dives at you talons first (its windup row lifts its wings
        // high). It has no shot: a floater that strikes in melee dives, so it is
        // `Aerial`.
