            idle: ["*a long, high whistle*", "*it adjusts its hood, which is not on*"],
            hall: ["On the steppe the eagle hunters hunt foxes with us, and wolves if the hunter is brave. The hunter is never as brave as I am.", "The hood keeps me calm. It is off now. Draw your own conclusions."],
