        barks: (
            on_hit: ["Ow! Me gums!", "That went right through me. Most things do."],
            provoked: ["Have ye... got... a LEMON?"],
            idle: ["*gums smack*", "Lemon... lemon...", "Ninety days out of port, and not one orange."],
            hall: ["In 1747 a ship's surgeon gave two of us lemons and they got better. The navy took nearly fifty years to listen. I did not have fifty years.", "I lost my teeth off the Cape of Good Hope. Bad Hope, if you ask me."],
