            provoked: ["*the tail tip twitches*"],
            idle: ["*a deep purr*", "*it licks a paw*", "Grrrumph."],
            hall: ["Every painter in every cave drew me. Not one of them drew me a mane. I did not have one. I am fine about it.", "Bigger than a lion of today, and the painters still put me on the back wall. Behind a horse."],
        ),
        ),
        // The hippo: a hippopotamus of the lakes of the Green Sahara, very
        // angry, its mouth always a little open. It yawns its jaws wide (its
        // windup row), charges a short heavy way and bites down, then stands a
        // long moment: the opening.
