        // grid. Their sheets are in the renderer
        // (`targets/characters/_history_americas_kit.py`, `_history_felid.py`).
        // The smilodon: the sabre-toothed cat of Beringia, heavy, tawny, with
        // two long sabres. A pouncer: it crouches low with its rump wiggling
        // (its windup row), leaps a long way with its jaw wide open, then
        // needs a moment to get up: the opening.
        "smilodon": (
            sprite_tuning: Some((collision_scale: 1.0, frame_sample_inset: 1)),
            display_name: "Smilodon",
