            provoked: ["*a low, sawing roar*"],
            idle: ["*it washes a paw*", "*its tail twitches in the maize*", "Mmrr."],
            hall: ["I swim, I climb, and I bite through a turtle's shell. The other big cats find me exhausting.", "Every spot on me is a rosette with a dot in the middle. Leopards have no dot. I like to mention it."],
        ),
        ),
