            idle: ["*chew* *chew* *chew*", "Hmmmm.", "*it stares at nothing, unimpressed*"],
            hall: ["The Inca road ran for forty thousand kilometres through the Andes, and we carried most of it. Nobody built us a road.", "I carry thirty kilos and not one gram more. Put a thirty-first on me and I lie down. That is not stubborn. That is a union."],
        ),
        ),
