                hall: ["Forty years on that shore. The sea has given me two anchors, a harpsichord and a man who said he was a duke.", "Wreckers light false lights. I sell the bulbs back to them."],
            ),
        ),
        "npc_village_sato": (
            display_name: "Sato",
